{#
  預訂頁中間（頁首、頁尾在 canvas-page.njk）：照 Canva「UI v4｜預訂第 1 步：選購（七區塊）」的尺寸排版，
  但是一般網頁排版（不是固定座標）：客人勾選項目時列數會變，卡片會跟著長高。
  - 第 1 步七區塊的列由 assets/js/booking.js 依 prices.json 產生；算錢只用 assets/js/pricing.js（跟 npm test 同一份）
  - 第 2–4 步（11/18 Ambre：送審需要，不能捨棄；Canva 沒有這幾頁 → 延續第 1 步的風格）：
    同一個網址，一次只顯示一步（網址後面 #step-2／#step-3／#step-4），右側訂單摘要一直在
  - 尺寸對照：Canva x 座標原樣；Canva y 座標 ＋100 ＝ 網頁 y（上面加了 136px 的共用頁首）
#}
<div class="bk" id="bk" data-step="1">
  <div class="bk-head">
    <p class="bk-eyebrow" id="bk-eyebrow">BOOKING　·　線上預訂（第 1 步：選購）</p>
    <h1 class="bk-h1">住宿。潛水。水陸活動都能玩！</h1>
    <label class="bk-date-label" for="bk-date">出發日期</label>
    <input class="bk-date" type="date" name="date" id="bk-date" form="booking-form" required>
    <a class="bk-start" href="#bk-blocks"><img src="/assets/img/booking/booking_chevron.webp" alt="" width="57" height="61"><span>開始訂製</span></a>
    <ol class="bk-steps" aria-label="預訂步驟">
      <li data-s="1"><span class="bk-num">1</span>選購</li><li data-s="2"><span class="bk-num">2</span>填資料</li><li data-s="3"><span class="bk-num">3</span>確認條款</li><li data-s="4"><span class="bk-num">4</span>付款</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <nav class="bk-toc" aria-label="快速選購項目"><p class="bk-toc-h">快速選購項目</p><ol id="bk-toc-list"></ol></nav>
  <div class="bk-grid">
    <form class="bk-main" id="booking-form" novalidate>
      {# ---------- 第 1 步：選購（Canva UI v4） ---------- #}
      <div class="bk-stepview" data-step="1">
        <div id="bk-blocks"><div class="bk-card"><p class="bk-intro">預訂表載入中……如果一直沒出現，請加 <a href="{{ site.company.lineUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LINE 官方帳號</a>預訂。</p></div></div>
        <div class="bk-card bk-totalbar">
          <p class="bk-total-text">合計　<strong id="cart-total">NT$ 0</strong></p>
          <button type="button" class="bk-btn bk-next" data-go="2">下一步：填資料</button>
          <p class="bk-pick-msg" data-msg="1" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {# ---------- 第 2 步：填資料 ---------- #}
      <div class="bk-stepview" data-step="2" hidden>
        <section class="bk-card bk-stepcard" aria-labelledby="bk-s2-h">
          <h2 class="bk-title" id="bk-s2-h"><span class="bk-num">2</span>聯絡人資料</h2>
          <p class="bk-intro">出發前我們會用電話或 LINE 跟你確認船班和集合時間；出生年月日是保險要用的。</p>
          <div class="bk-fields">
            <label class="bk-field"><span>聯絡人姓名</span><input name="name" required placeholder="你的名字" autocomplete="name"></label>
            <label class="bk-field"><span>手機</span><input name="phone" required placeholder="09xx-xxx-xxx" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel"></label>
            <label class="bk-field"><span>Email</span><input name="email" type="email" required placeholder="name@example.com" autocomplete="email"></label>
            <label class="bk-field"><span>出生年月日（保險用）</span><input name="birthday" type="date" required></label>
            <label class="bk-field"><span>緊急聯絡人</span><input name="emergencyName" required placeholder="姓名／關係"></label>
            <label class="bk-field"><span>緊急聯絡人電話</span><input name="emergencyPhone" required placeholder="09xx-xxx-xxx" inputmode="tel"></label>
          </div>
          <label class="bk-field bk-field-wide"><span>備註（健康狀況、近視度數、飲食需求）</span><textarea name="note" rows="3" placeholder="例如：近視 400 度、不吃牛肉。"></textarea></label>
        </section>
        <section class="bk-card bk-stepcard" aria-labelledby="bk-s2b-h">
          <h2 class="bk-title" id="bk-s2b-h"><span class="bk-num">2</span>其他參加者</h2>
          <p class="bk-intro">每位參加者都要填姓名和出生年月日（保險用）。只有你一個人就不用填。</p>
          <div id="participants"></div>
          <button type="button" class="bk-link" id="add-person">＋ 新增參加者</button>
        </section>
        <div class="bk-card bk-totalbar">
          <p class="bk-total-text">合計　<strong class="js-total">NT$ 0</strong></p>
          <button type="button" class="bk-btn bk-back" data-go="1">上一步</button>
          <button type="button" class="bk-btn bk-next" data-go="3">下一步：確認條款</button>
          <p class="bk-pick-msg" data-msg="2" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {# ---------- 第 3 步：確認條款 ---------- #}
      <div class="bk-stepview" data-step="3" hidden>
        <section class="bk-card bk-stepcard" aria-labelledby="bk-s3-h">
          <h2 class="bk-title" id="bk-s3-h"><span class="bk-num">3</span>確認條款</h2>
          <p class="bk-intro">請先看過條款，四個都勾選才能前往付款。條款會開在新分頁，填的資料不會不見。</p>
          <div class="bk-checks">
            <label><input type="checkbox" class="bk-check" required> 我已閱讀並同意〈<a href="/terms/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">服務條款</a>〉</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" class="bk-check" required> 我已閱讀並同意〈<a href="/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">隱私權政策</a>〉</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" class="bk-check" required> 我已閱讀並同意〈<a href="/refund/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">退款與停航政策</a>〉</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" class="bk-check" required> 潛水行程：我會在出發前填寫 PADI 健康問卷</label>
          </div>
        </section>
        <div class="bk-card bk-totalbar">
          <p class="bk-total-text">合計　<strong class="js-total">NT$ 0</strong></p>
          <button type="button" class="bk-btn bk-back" data-go="2">上一步</button>
          <button type="button" class="bk-btn bk-next" data-go="4">前往付款</button>
          <p class="bk-pick-msg" data-msg="3" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {# ---------- 第 4 步：付款 ---------- #}
      <div class="bk-stepview" data-step="4" hidden>
        <section class="bk-card bk-stepcard" aria-labelledby="bk-s4-h">
          <h2 class="bk-title" id="bk-s4-h"><span class="bk-num">4</span>付款</h2>
          <p class="bk-intro">線上刷卡開通中，目前請用<strong>銀行匯款</strong>或 <strong>PayPal</strong> 付款。</p>
          <p class="bk-paymsg" id="form-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite">請先{% if site.company.lineUrl %}加 <a class="bk-hl" href="{{ site.company.lineUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LINE 官方帳號</a>{% else %}加 LINE 官方帳號{% endif %}，告訴我們出發日期和右邊的訂單內容，<strong class="bk-hl">確認名額後再付款</strong>。付款後請傳匯款帳號後五碼（或 PayPal 付款紀錄）給我們。</p>
          {%- set pay = site.payment %}
          <div class="bk-info bk-pay">
            <div><h3>國內匯款</h3><p>{{ pay.domestic.bank }}<br>帳號　<b>{{ pay.domestic.account }}</b><br>戶名　{{ pay.domestic.name }}</p></div>
            <div><h3>國外匯款</h3><p lang="en">{{ pay.intl.bank }}<br>Bank address: {{ pay.intl.address }}<br>A/C no. <b>{{ pay.intl.account }}</b><br>SWIFT code: <b>{{ pay.intl.swift }}</b><br>A/C name: {{ pay.intl.name }}</p></div>
            <div><h3>PayPal</h3><p>帳號　<b>{{ pay.paypal.account }}</b><br>{{ pay.paypal.noteZh }}</p></div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="bk-card bk-stepcard" aria-labelledby="bk-s4b-h">
          <h2 class="bk-title" id="bk-s4b-h"><span class="bk-num">4</span>付款完成之後</h2>
          <div class="bk-success">
            <span class="bk-success-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <div>
              <p class="bk-success-h">預訂成功！</p>
              <p class="bk-muted">訂單編號　付款完成後會顯示在這裡和確認信上</p>
              <p>確認信會寄到你填的 Email，裡面有訂單明細和付款紀錄。<br>出發前，我們會用電話或 LINE 跟你確認船班和集合時間。<br>沒收到確認信？先看垃圾信件匣，或<a href="{{ site.company.lineUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">加 LINE</a> 找我們。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bk-info">
            <div><h3>付款方式</h3><p>銀行匯款、PayPal；線上刷卡（PAYUNi 統一金流）開通中。</p></div>
            <div><h3>改期或取消</h3><p>天候或停航造成的取消，可以改期或退款。其他情況請看<a href="/refund/">〈退款與停航政策〉</a>。</p></div>
            <div><h3>查詢訂單</h3><p>用確認信上的訂單編號，傳 LINE 給我們（<a href="/about/#contact">聯絡我們</a>）。</p></div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <div class="bk-card bk-totalbar">
          <p class="bk-total-text">合計　<strong class="js-total">NT$ 0</strong></p>
          <button type="button" class="bk-btn bk-back" data-go="3">上一步</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </form>

    <aside class="bk-side">
      <div class="bk-summary" aria-live="polite">
        <h2 class="bk-sum-h">訂單摘要</h2>
        <p class="bk-sum-date" id="sum-date">尚未選日期</p>
        <hr class="bk-bar">
        <ul class="bk-sum-lines" id="sum-lines"></ul>
        <hr class="bk-bar">
        <p class="bk-sum-total"><span>合計</span><strong id="sum-total">NT$ 0</strong></p>
        <button type="button" class="bk-btn bk-next" id="sum-next" data-go="2">下一步：填資料</button>
        <p class="bk-sum-note">付款完成並收到確認信，訂單才算成立。</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" id="price-data">{{ prices | dump | safe }}</script>
</div>
